    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your team. Control the franchise. Become a  legend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the locker room and take control of a professional football franchise in <strong>Ultimate Pro Football Coach</strong>, a deep, strategic simulation where every decision matters: Scout hidden gems, sign superstar free agents, hire staff, manage finances, and navigate the pressure of ownership and fans as you build your football dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re rebuilding a bottom-tier team or chasing a three-peat, the future of your franchise is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795200/extras/b707a4e283499e6e4dfae479475463dd.avif?t=1753649425\" alt=\"Coach Progression\" width=616 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Coach Simulation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coach career progression,  dynamic career milestones and coach upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic player attributes, player styles, mentality and traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth coach, team, and player stat tracking,  suspensions, and injuries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yearly awards, All-Pro selections,  Hall of Fame and complete tracking across decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795200/extras/03214910940ffb6143f5381c723de0b7.avif?t=1753649425\" width=630 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Strategy and Playbook Control </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ Built-In Plays</strong>: Start with a deep library of offensive plays designed for various situations, formations, and styles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Play Creator</strong>: Design your own plays from scratch \u2014 assign routes, player roles, and timing with intuitive playbook tools.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formations &amp; Strategy</strong>: \u00a0Set your offensive scheme and build game plans around your unique offensive identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795200/extras/96df22c13c3a0e3073cb6ad268a8cf89.avif?t=1753649425\" width=631 height=257 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Game Day Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Game Engine</strong>: Experience smooth top-down gameplay with realistic movement driven by player attributes, positional roles, and overall team dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Play Calling</strong>: Take command of the offense during key drives, selecting plays based on down, distance, and momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Adjustments</strong>: Change tempo, swap strategies, or lean into your opponent\u2019s weaknesses as the game evolves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795200/extras/14cdc3ee9e622ac9639b34a0f2af5732.avif?t=1753649425\" width=644 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Franchise Mode </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft, trade, and develop players through a dynamic career system.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate contracts, manage salary cap, and balance your books.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire coordinators and staff members who shape your team\u2019s identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve team performance with stadium and facility upgrades and training investments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign franchise sponsorship deals to increase income and athletic gear contracts to boost player abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set seasonal goals with the franchise owner to earn income boosts for your on-field performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795200/extras/dadf9c6749905f8eca310be05de42bf6.avif?t=1753649425\" alt=\"Front Office Control\" width=616 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comprehensive  Front Office Management</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Cap Control</strong>: Navigate the complexities of multi-year contract structuring, cap rollover strategies and front/back-loaded deals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Draft Day Experience</strong>: Navigate a live draft room with scouting insights, player projections, trade offers, and real-time team board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Training Systems</strong>: Develop both staff and players through structured regimens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ring of Honor Integration</strong>: Hire legendary retired players as coaches or staff members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awards and Hall of Fame Trackers</strong>: Monitor player award selections and celebrate long-term career achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Trade Engine</strong>: Balanced AI trading with value-based logic and negotiation options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player/Coach/Staff Customization</strong>: Edit names, appearances, player numbers and outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom League Files</strong>: Community-built team files with custom names, logos, and designs to personalize your franchise experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795200/extras/dd75386711a591e8c68b0153dc40f8c4.avif?t=1753649425\" alt=\"Football League News\" width=616 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Every Decision</strong>\u00a0<strong>Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own path as a legendary coach-\u00a0<br>Will you build a dynasty through elite scouting and drafting?<br>Dominate free agency with bold moves?<br>Or will you focus on long-term financial stability, staff growth, and internal development?<br>  <br>Choose your approach and build a culture that lasts generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your franchise. Your rules. Your dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
